#: ../../source/workflows/mangrove_mapping.rst:278
msgid "7. Create the high-confidence mangrove reference map"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/mangrove_mapping.rst:280
msgid ""
"This step converts the three global datasets into a single high-"
"confidence binary map of mangrove and non-mangrove, which is then used to"
" automatically generate training data for the local classification."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/mangrove_mapping.rst:282
msgid ""
"If multiple independent global datasets agree that a pixel is mangrove "
"(or non-mangrove), confidence in that label is much higher than if only "
"one dataset indicates this. The elevation constraint further removes "
"unlikely mangrove locations."
msgstr ""

